# nav-probe actions: Rise of the Witch-king from the main menu to a skirmish against the AI, then
# two minutes of in-game sensors. Coordinates are the label hit rectangles read from the APT
# menu textures (800×600). Its layout differs from BFME II: SOLO is the leftmost button, its
# submenu starts with ESCARMOUCHE, and the setup screen opens under an "Ajouter un nouveau profil"
# dialog (name field 274–395 × 270–299, ACCEPTER 255–375 × 386–416) that must be filled before
# JOUER (616–749 × 554–594) does anything. The presentation path is forced direct: the bench's
# CPU readback path degrades over minutes.
dbg d3d9DirectPresent true
wait 20
click 85,556
quick click 85,381
wait 6
uimap
quick click 334,284
type Bench
quick click 315,401
wait 4
uimap
quick click 682,574
wait 15
wait 15
wait 15
wait 15
wait 15
wait 15
wait 15
wait 15
dbg faults
dbg messageBoxes
harness stubs
dbg waitGraph
quit
